    "text": "procedure Show_Postcondition_Violation is\n\n   procedure Absolute (X : in out Integer) with\n     Post => X >= 0 is\n   begin\n      if X > 0 then\n         X := -X;\n      end if;\n   end Absolute;\n\n   X : Integer;\n\nbegin\n   X := 1;\n   Absolute (X);\nend Show_Postcondition_Violation;\n",
